1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,927
You've just been bitten by a werewolf.

2
00:00:02,977 --> 00:00:05,009
Would you survive one week?

3
00:00:05,239 --> 00:00:05,814
Day one.

4
00:00:05,864 --> 00:00:07,759
The dog won't come near you.

5
00:00:07,989 --> 00:00:08,574
Day two.

6
00:00:08,624 --> 00:00:09,620
Full moon.

7
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,500
Lock the door.

8
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:11,660
Key out of the window.

9
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:12,687
Easy.

10
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:13,697
Day three.

11
00:00:13,747 --> 00:00:15,217
You wake up on your doorstep,

12
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:16,578
covered in mud.

13
00:00:16,628 --> 00:00:18,823
Your watch logged the whole night.

14
00:00:18,873 --> 00:00:20,078
Thirty-one miles.

15
00:00:20,128 --> 00:00:21,492
Personal best.

16
00:00:21,962 --> 00:00:24,780
And forty minutes stopped at a sheep farm.

17
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:25,905
Then it buzzes.

18
00:00:25,955 --> 00:00:27,707
Full moon again tonight.

19
00:00:27,757 --> 00:00:29,662
Ready for another run?
